I am very late to this discussion, have skimmed it, yet am not sure the
following is useful. Quite some time ago I installed the DICT Extension for
Firefox and pointed it to the Lojban dict server.  Within Firefox I can
right-click on a Lojban word, choose "Define '[word]'", and the jbovlaste
definition pops up. < https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/302 >

Hope this helps. mu'o mi'e komfo,amonan

